        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Cloud Form"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, polymorph)\n\nThe nue changes its shape into that of a dark storm cloud. In Cloud Form, the nue is concealed, gains a 60-foot fly Speed, gains a +4 status bonus to its Deception DC to prevent others from seeing through its disguise, and can't make attacks, though it can use its howl abilities. The nue can Dismiss this effect."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "c5b69b7f-7fdd-4b79-a59b-92817ae1af79",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:07.361623"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Monstrous Howl"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, mental, void)\n\nThe nue lets out an eerie howl that rattles creatures' very souls. Creatures within 60 feet must attempt a 27 Will save (29 at night). They're then temporarily immune to Monstrous Howl for 10 minutes.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes 2d8 persistent void damage.\n- **Failure:** As success, plus the target is drained 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** As success, plus the target is drained 2 and stunned 1."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "a747c2f3-e2be-44f8-9ba4-5c9ae0c399e1",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:07.361623"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Thundering Howl"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(electricity)\n\nThe nue howls to the sky, calling down a bolt of lightning that strikes the creature closest to the nue, to a maximum range of 60 feet. The bolt deals 12d6 electricity damage (27 basic Reflex save). The nue then can't use Thundering Howl for 1d4 rounds."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
